'''Sector delta''' was a location near the [[Umbaran airbase]] on the dark [[Planet|world]] of [[Umbara]] in the [[Expansion Region]]. During the [[Battle of Umbara]], the [[Galactic Republic]]'s [[501st Legion]] was able to capture the [[Umbaran]] airbase from the [[Umbaran militia]]. While stationed in the base, the [[212th Attack Battalion]] came under fire from long-range [[missile]]s supplied by a [[Dual Hemisphere-Omni Support Vessel|Separatist supply ship]] during their effort to take the [[Umbaran capital city]]. [[Jedi General]] [[Pong Krell]], secretly an [[agent]] of [[Dooku]], strategized to deploy all of his troops to capture the capital.<ref name="Plan" />

When [[Advanced Recon Commando]] [[Fives|CT-5555]] "Fives" became aware of the plan, he remarked that the [[battalion]] would not make it past the delta. [[Time|Sometime]] later, while [[Clone Captain]] [[Rex|CT-7567]] "Rex" conversed with [[General]] Krell in the command tower, a [[clone trooper]] noted that there were incoming missiles heading to sector delta.<ref name="Plan" />

